    skos:definition "Used when a bdqval:taxonIsMarine sourceAuthority is unable to assert the marine or non-marine status of a taxon, the biome (either \"marine\" or \"nonmarine\") to assume, with the default being \"noassumption\"."@en ;
    skos:inScheme bdqval: ;
    skos:note "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">See VALIDATION_COORDINATESTERRESTRIALMARINE_CONSISTENT (bdqtest:b9c184ce-a859-410c-9d12-71a338200380).</div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ;
